            <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt;">
              <div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 10pt;">Please direct any investor questions to Munjal Shah at munjal.shah@synaptics.com.</div>
            </td>
